  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nAs a Homarr user, I want to have a settings on my board so that when I click on an app, it will open the app in the same tab by default. It is a pain to set this for every app.\n\nSimilar to the existing `pingEnabled` feature (add an option and use the settings to define the defaultValue)\n\n### Additional information\n\nOriginally posted https://github.com/ajnart/homarr/issues/2252",
